                "description": "Fusion AU-A7, Turnberry Lever with Contoured Radius Rose - The classic look of Fusion Hardware's Contoured Radius Rose with Turnberry Lever is great for traditional as well as modern style homes. This solid brass leverset comes in an oil rubbed bronze finish. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
